# Canonical author names and addresses.
#
# This maps the identities recorded in commits to preferred ones, so that
# `git shortlog -sne`, `git log` and `git blame` credit each contributor once
# and under a real address. It changes how authorship is displayed only --
# no history is rewritten.
#
# Format: Proper Name <preferred@email> <email-as-recorded-in-commits>

